1
00:00:05,099 --> 00:00:07,169
(snoring)

2
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:21,610
(Leonard:)Okay, why?

3
00:00:21,616 --> 00:00:23,816
(Sheldon:)I'm listening to you snore.

4
00:00:23,818 --> 00:00:26,988
(Sheldon:)I'm wondering how
I'll ever sleep without it.

5
00:00:26,988 --> 00:00:29,758
(Leonard:)If it helps you sleep,

6
00:00:29,757 --> 00:00:31,587
(Leonard:)then why are you sitting here
staring at me

7
00:00:31,592 --> 00:00:33,862
(Leonard:)like the albino boogeyman?

8
00:00:35,630 --> 00:00:37,260
(Sheldon:)Really, Leonard-- insults?

9
00:00:37,265 --> 00:00:38,835
(Sheldon:)After I spent two hours
in your closet,

10
00:00:38,833 --> 00:00:40,233
(Sheldon:)waiting for you to fall asleep?

11
00:00:43,604 --> 00:00:44,774
(Leonard:)What's your problem?

12
00:00:44,772 --> 00:00:48,772
(Sheldon:)If the surgery is successful,
the snoring is gone.

13
00:00:48,776 --> 00:00:51,246
(Sheldon:)And if you die during surgery...

14
00:00:52,146 --> 00:00:54,546
(Sheldon:)...the snoring is gone.

15
00:00:55,850 --> 00:00:59,320
(Leonard:)It sounds like either way,
I finally get some rest.

16
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:01,150
(Sheldon:)I have to be honest
with you Leonard,

